# Let's go

When the user says "let's go", follow `docs/WORKFLOW.md`.

If pull requests are open and this chat did not open them, review that set. One subagent per pull request. Merge in task-number order. Do not implement.

If none are waiting, take every Ready task that can run together: Owns do not overlap, and at most one Lane C task. One subagent per task. A lone Ready task, a spike, or the catalog export is a single task. Do not continue into tasks that are still Blocked.

Do only what each task's Done when list requires. Use the smallest change. Ask the user for a missing fact or credential and wait. Do not invent it.

Each task gets its own branch and pull request. The failing test is committed first. Do not review your own pull request.
